{
  "page": 449,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3865,
      "text": "Dan Kami jadikan anak cucunya orang-orang yang melanjutkan keturunan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3866,
      "text": "Dan Kami abadikan untuk Nuh (pujian) di kalangan orang-orang yang datang kemudian;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3867,
      "text": "\"Kesejahteraan (Kami limpahkan) atas Nuh di seluruh alam.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3868,
      "text": "Sungguh, demikianlah Kami memberi balasan kepada orang-orang yang berbuat baik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3869,
      "text": "Sungguh, dia termasuk hamba-hamba Kami yang beriman.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3870,
      "text": "Kemudian Kami tenggelamkan yang lain.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3871,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Ibrahim termasuk golongannya (Nuh).729)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3872,
      "text": "(Ingatlah) ketika dia datang kepada Tuhannya dengan hati yang suci,730)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3873,
      "text": "(ingatlah) ketika dia berkata kepada ayahnya dan kaumnya, \"Apakah yang kamu sembah itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3874,
      "text": "Apakah kamu menghendaki kebohongan dengan sesembahan selain Allah itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3875,
      "text": "Maka bagaimana anggapanmu terhadap Tuhan seluruh alam?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3876,
      "text": "Lalu dia memandang sekilas ke bintang-bintang,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3877,
      "text": "kemudian dia (Ibrahim) berkata, \"Sesungguhnya aku sakit.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3878,
      "text": "Lalu mereka berpaling darinya dan pergi meninggalkannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3879,
      "text": "Kemudian dia (Ibrahim) pergi dengan diam-diam kepada berhala-berhala mereka; lalu dia berkata, \"Mengapa kamu tidak makan?731)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3880,
      "text": "Mengapa kamu tidak menjawab?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3881,
      "text": "Lalu dihadapinya (berhala-berhala) itu sambil memukulnya dengan tangan kanannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3882,
      "text": "Kemudian mereka (kaumnya) datang bergegas kepadanya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3883,
      "text": "Dia (Ibrahim) berkata, \"Apakah kamu menyembah patung-patung yang kamu pahat itu?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3884,
      "text": "Padahal Allah lah yang menciptakan kamu dan apa yang kamu perbuat.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3885,
      "text": "Mereka berkata, \"Buatlah bangunan (perapian) untuknya (membakar Ibrahim); lalu lemparkan dia ke dalam api yang menyala-nyala itu.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3886,
      "text": "Maka mereka bermaksud memperdayainya dengan (membakar)nya, (namun Allah menyelamatkannya), lalu Kami jadikan mereka orang-orang yang hina.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3887,
      "text": "Dan dia (Ibrahim) berkata, \"Sesungguhnya aku harus pergi (menghadap) kepada Tuhanku, Dia akan memberi petunjuk kepadaku.732)",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3888,
      "text": "Ya Tuhanku, anugerahkanlah kepadaku (seorang anak) yang saleh.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3889,
      "text": "Maka Kami beri kabar gembira kepadanya dengan (kelahiran) seorang anak yang sangat sabar (Ismail).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3890,
      "text": "Maka ketika anak itu sampai (pada umur) sanggup berusaha bersamanya, (Ibrahim) berkata, \"Wahai anakku! Sesungguhnya aku bermimpi bahwa aku menyembelihmu. Maka bagaimanakah pendapatmu?\" Dia (Ismail) menjawab, \"Wahai ayahku! Lakukanlah apa yang diperintahkan (Allah) kepadamu; insyā Allah engkau akan mendapatiku termasuk orang yang sabar.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
